[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8952.87, "timestamp": "02:29:12", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8956.269, "timestamp": "02:29:16", "text": "M 3 有小睡，不，就像呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8959.79, "timestamp": "02:29:19", "text": "这里因为天气太热，所以特别难熬。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8964.83, "timestamp": "02:29:24", "text": "我们现在正在进行中，所以我当时就想，真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8967.87, "timestamp": "02:29:27", "text": "自施工以来，我一直在大量出汗。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8970.99, "timestamp": "02:29:30", "text": "自从停电以来，就一直停电了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8973.75, "timestamp": "02:29:33", "text": "我们不得不把……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8976.95, "timestamp": "02:29:36", "text": "工人们，呃，我想那里有……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8978.55, "timestamp": "02:29:38", "text": "焊接工作之类的，我也不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8980.429, "timestamp": "02:29:40", "text": "有些，有些则不同。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8982.87, "timestamp": "02:29:42", "text": "进出的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8984.389, "timestamp": "02:29:44", "text": "建造"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8988.389, "timestamp": "02:29:48", "text": "东西，所以，嗯，所以，我当时就想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8992.11, "timestamp": "02:29:52", "text": "看着画家们作画是一种享受。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8994.03, "timestamp": "02:29:54", "text": "有一种东西叫做底漆或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8996.07, "timestamp": "02:29:56", "text": "某种水泥底漆之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8998.75, "timestamp": "02:29:58", "text": "在添加之前添加的一种涂层"}]